# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Order (0.4.3 fix round): Ironforge first (the Hearthstone from Un'Goro), Chillwind Camp, the Burning Steppes and the
# Blasted Lands at 50-51, back through Ironforge and the boat to Auberdine, and Azshara last, from Astranaar, at about
# 51.5, where Felwood starts next door. Since the 2026-11-20 fix pass the guide no longer goes up to Darnassus: Erelas'
# feathers (3661), Jenal's soil (3764, then Fandral's 3781) and Gracina's Rise of the Silithid (162) go in on the
# Felwood guide's Darnassus stop, which walks past all three (Darnassus 3 visits -> 2). Azshara used to open the guide
# at 50: Kim'jael's blood elves (51-53) and Lord Sarthiss (52)
# needed a top-up to 51.3 first (about 140k XP of grinding for the level model's player), and the guide then hearthed
# from Azshara to Ironforge and came back to Ashenvale by boat at the end.
# Added here: A Taste of Flame (4023).
# A Taste of Flame (4022) instead for the group that did Velarok's chain to Trinkets... (3481) in 40-50/06: the hoard it
# gives holds the Black Dragonflight Molt, so Cyrus takes it at once with no drake to fight.
# Petty Squabbles (2783) and A Tale of Sorrow (2801), 5,100 XP: Ardalan in Nethergarde Keep, where the flight lands,
# and the Fallen Hero just over the Swamp of Sorrows border, on the Blasted Lands stop before the hearth.
# To Serve Kum'isha (2521) when a Blasted Lands mob dropped the Flawless Draenethyst Sphere: Kum'isha is on the route.
# Left out: Dark Iron Legacy (3801). At Last! (3201): Curator Thorius offers it only after Proof of Deed (3182), the
# group chain behind Margol's Horn, and it sends you back to Loch Modan.
# Better Late Than Never (5021, 5022), Janice Felstone at the Felstone Field farmhouse, is taken on the Western
# Plaguelands guide's Felstone Field cauldron stop: the Jabbering Ghouls (54) around the farmhouse are over players here.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ironforge

step To Ironforge
  zone Ironforge
  tip Your Hearthstone is set at Ironforge (the Hinterlands guide binds it there): hearth back to the inn from Un'Goro.
  goto 18.15,51.45 "Ironforge inn"

step Mystic Ward
  only Priest,Mage
  accept 8254 npc 11406 only Priest   -- High Priest Rohan: for Ogtinc in Azshara, at the end of this guide: keep it
  accept 8250 npc 7312 only Mage      -- Dink, the mage trainer: for Sanath Lim-yo in Azshara, at the end of this guide: keep it

step Ironforge
  only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  zone Ironforge
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock

step Courier Hammerfall
  zone Ironforge
  tip Courier Hammerfall rides around the city's ring on his ram: catch him as he passes.
  accept 5090                         -- For Commander Ashlam Valorfist at Chillwind Camp, the next stop

step Royal Historian Archesonus
  zone Ironforge
  tip Archesonus stands beside King Magni in the High Seat.
  accept 3702
  talk 8879 quest 3702.1
  turnin 3702

step Royal Historian Archesonus
  when group 3701
  zone Ironforge
  tip The Smoldering Ruins of Thaurissan is a group quest at this level: its relics stand among War Reavers and Firewalkers of 53-55, with Thauris Balgarr (57) close by, two to five over you, and the route has no later Burning Steppes visit. Grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Skip it if you are alone.
  accept 3701                         -- The relics are in the Burning Steppes: keep it

step Fly to Aerie Peak
  when group 2944
  zone Ironforge
  goto 55.9,47.9 "Ironforge flight master"
  fly "Aerie Peak"
  zone The Hinterlands

step Fly to Southshore
  when !group 2944
  zone Ironforge
  goto 55.9,47.9 "Ironforge flight master"
  fly "Southshore"
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Hinterlands and the Western Plaguelands

step The Super Snapper FX
  when group 2944
  tip Gammerita need not die: target her and use the Super Snapper FX. She is a level 48 elite, so keep your distance.
  tip Gammerita walks the Hinterlands shore below the Overlook Cliffs, from the arrow south to about 75,66 and north to about 82,52: if she isn't at the arrow, follow the shore.
  use 9328 quest 2944.1 @80.4,58.2 map 1425 -- the Super Snapper FX on Gammerita: no kill

step Fly to Southshore
  when group 2944
  zone The Hinterlands
  goto 11.1,46.1 "Aerie Peak flight master"
  fly "Southshore"
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills

step Orphan Matron Aria
  zone Alterac Mountains
  tip Ride north from Southshore into Alterac and west to the walls of Dalaran: Orphan Matron Aria stands outside them. Her quest goes to Lieutenant Connar in Nethergarde Keep, where this guide flies later.
  accept 96797

step Western Plaguelands
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Ride north from Southshore up the road through Alterac to Chillwind Camp.
  goto 42.9,85.0 "Chillwind Camp"

step Chillwind Camp
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Commander Ashlam Valorfist stands in the middle of the camp.
  getfp "Chillwind Camp"
  turnin 5090                         -- Commander Ashlam Valorfist
  accept 5092

step Sorrow Hill: kill these as you meet them
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Skeletal Flayers and Slavering Ghouls (50) roam the fields north of the camp; all the Scourge here drop Scourgestones.
  tip Careful: These undead notice you from far away, and other undead nearby join the fight when one is pulled.
  tip Careful: The Eye of Naxxramas (3 spawns, 15 min respawn) turns invisible when out of combat and calls in Rockwing Gargoyles once a fight starts.
  kill 1783 quest 5092.1              -- Skeletal Flayer
  kill 1791 quest 5092.2              -- Slavering Ghoul

step Chillwind Camp
  tip Ride back south to the camp.
  turnin 5092                         -- Commander Ashlam Valorfist
  accept 5215
  turnin 5215                         -- High Priestess MacDonnell
  accept 5216                         -- keep it: the Felstone Field cauldron waits for the Western Plaguelands guide

step Fly to Morgan's Vigil
  when taxi "Morgan's Vigil"
  zone Western Plaguelands
  goto 43.0,85.1 "Chillwind Camp flight master"
  fly "Morgan's Vigil"
  zone Burning Steppes

step Fly to Lakeshire
  when !taxi "Morgan's Vigil"
  zone Western Plaguelands
  goto 43.0,85.1 "Chillwind Camp flight master"
  fly "Lakeshire"
  zone Redridge Mountains

step Morgan's Vigil flight master
  when !taxi "Morgan's Vigil"
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Ride east out of Lakeshire and up the pass into the Burning Steppes: Morgan's Vigil stands at the top.
  getfp "Morgan's Vigil"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Burning Steppes

step Morgan's Vigil
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Morgan's Vigil sits in the south-east of the Steppes, at the top of the pass up from Redridge.
  accept 3823

step Dreadmaul Rock
  tip The Firegut ogres hold the great rock north of the Vigil, with the Brutes on its east side.
  tip Careful: the Firegut Ogres are 50 and the Ogre Mages 51, but the Brutes on the rock's east side are 52: take the ogres on the near side first and pull the Brutes one at a time.
  tip Careful: Escaped Core Hounds (level 60) roam the Steppes, a few on the slopes west and south of Dreadmaul Rock: pull the ogres on the rock itself and look around before each pull.
  tip Careful: the Firegut chiefs Hahk'Zor and Gorgon'och (54) stand on the rock's east side among the Brutes: leave them be.
  kill 7034 quest 3823.1              -- Firegut Ogre Mage, below ground
  kill 7033 quest 3823.2              -- Firegut Ogre
  kill 7035 quest 3823.3              -- Firegut Brute

step Morgan's Vigil
  zone Burning Steppes
  turnin 3823                         -- Oralius
  note Oralius' next tasks (Gor'tesh, and fifty Blackrock Medallions) send you among the Blackrock orcs of 55-58 at the foot of Blackrock Mountain: skip them.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Flame Crest and the Ruins of Thaurissan

step Flame Crest
  tip Follow the road west, then climb north to the goblin camp on Flame Crest.
  accept 4726                         -- Tinkee Steamboil

step Ruins of Thaurissan: kill these as you meet them
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Use the Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 on a Black Broodling on the slopes east of Flame Crest just before it dies, then loot the essence it leaves.
  tip Careful: a Malfunctioning Reaver (level 56, rare) walks the slopes by the broodlings, Volchan (60, a rare fire elemental) roams the hills east of Flame Crest, and the Black Dragonspawn and Wyrmkin around them are elite: use the Incarcinatrix on a broodling at the edge and look around before each pull.
  collect 12283 quest 4726.1
  use 12284 quest 4726.1 @81.0,28.0 map 1428

step Ruins of Thaurissan
  when group 3701
  when onquest 3701
  tip The relics are the carved stones scattered through the Ruins of Thaurissan around Flame Crest: click them until the information is recovered. Take the ones on the ruins' southern edge, nearest Flame Crest.
  tip Careful: the ruins' War Reavers and Thaurissan Firewalkers are 53-55, and Thauris Balgarr (57) holds the Dark Iron camp south-west of Flame Crest: take the relics at the edge of the ruins, pull one at a time, and keep away from the camp.
  interact 153556 quest 3701.1        -- Thaurissan Relic

step Flame Crest
  turnin 4726                         -- Tinkee Steamboil
  accept 4808                         -- Ends with Felnok Steelspring in Everlook, Winterspring: keep it

