  when turnedin 3481
  tip Open the Hoard of the Black Dragonflight from Searing Gorge for its Black Dragonflight Molt, then tell Cyrus you bring proof of your deeds: no drake to fight.
  tip Careful: Volchan (60, a rare fire elemental) roams the hills around Cyrus's cave: if he is about, wait for him to pass.
  accept 4022                         -- Below ground
  collect 10575 quest 4022.1          -- Black Dragonflight Molt, from the hoard
  talk 9459 quest 4022.2 @95.1,31.6 map 1428
  turnin 4022

step Cyrus Therepentous
