step Blasted Lands: kill these as you meet them
  zone Blasted Lands
  tip Ride back south into the Blasted Lands for the bloodmages' beasts: Starving Snickerfangs roam the dry hills south of the bloodmages' camp, Scorpok Stingers scuttle across the middle of the north and Black Slayer vultures circle over all of it. Ashmane Boars and Redstone Basilisks share the slopes south-west of the keep.
  tip Careful: two elites roam here: Calefactus the Unleashed (50) in the middle of the zone around 44,34, and Vek'zol (55) on the ridge around 39,32. When you see one, hunt somewhere else.
  tip Careful: Clack the Reaver (53, a rare scorpid) walks the north around 47,36, Akubar the Seer (54, rare) the middle around 45,48, and Snickerfang Matriarchs (60) roam the ground east of here, between Kum'isha's hill and the Serpent's Coil (about 54-62, 31-47): give them room.
  tip Any mob here may drop a Flawless Draenethyst Sphere: keep it for Kum'isha.
  collect 8244 optional               -- Flawless Draenethyst Sphere, a rare drop
  collect 8396 quest 2585
  collect 8396 quest 2601
  collect 8396 quest 2603             -- Vulture Gizzard
  collect 8392 quest 2581             -- Blasted Boar Lung
  collect 8392 quest 2583
  collect 8392 quest 2585
  collect 8394 quest 2601             -- Basilisk Brain
  collect 8394 quest 2583
  collect 8391 quest 2581             -- Snickerfang Jowl
  collect 8391 quest 2603
  collect 8393 quest 2581             -- Scorpok Pincer
  collect 8393 quest 2583
  collect 8393 quest 2585
  collect 280181 quest 87295.1        -- Redstone Basilisk Scale

step Blasted Lands
  zone Blasted Lands
  goto 52.0,35.7 "Rise of the Defiler"

step Kum'isha the Collector
  tip Kum'isha waits at the Rise of the Defiler, the hill south-west of the keep. The Blasted Lands mobs on the way drop the Imperfect Draenethyst Fragments; bring her what you have. Come at her hill straight from the keep, along the road, and leave by the same way.
  tip Careful: Felcular, Razelikh the Defiler and Ilifar are all level 60 elites. Razelikh casts Mana Burn, Strong Cleave and Decimate, and as its health drops it adds Razelikh's Tear, Flames of Chaos and then Enrage at 15%.
  tip Careful: Vek'zol, a level 55 elite, stands by Kum'isha's hill (about 50,35) and to the west (about 39,32), and the Dreadmaul and Shadowsworn camps around it are 53-55: take the fragments from the mobs on the way from the keep, not beside him.
  accept 3501                         -- Kum'isha the Collector walks around here: look inside the circle on the map
  collect 10593 quest 3501.1
  turnin 3501

step Kum'isha the Collector
  when has 8244
  tip A Blasted Lands mob dropped a Flawless Draenethyst Sphere: Kum'isha pays for it too.
  accept 2521
  turnin 2521

step Sergeant Danneth
  tip Ride east from Kum'isha's hill to the mouth of the Serpent's Coil caverns, due south of Nethergarde Keep: Danneth hides just inside.
  tip Careful: Snickerfang Matriarchs (60) roam the ground between Kum'isha's hill and the caverns: watch for them on the ride and go round them, there and back.
  tip Careful: Shadowsworn Cultists, Thugs and Adepts (51-52) guard the caves, and the deeper chambers hold Kirith the Damned (55, elite) and Archmage Allistarj (58, elite): stay near the mouth, pull one at a time, and lead Danneth straight out.
  turnin 96798 @66.73,31.67 map 1419
  accept 96811
  tip Walk him out of the caves and north to Nethergarde Keep: Connar takes him there.

step Nethergarde Keep
  tip Back north into Nethergarde Keep: Connar, then Danneth again once he is home. Bernie Heisten takes his scales here too.
  turnin 96811                        -- Lieutenant Connar
  accept 96799
  turnin 96799                        -- Sergeant Danneth
  accept 96812                        -- For Orphan Matron Aria in Alterac, on the Western & Eastern Plaguelands guide's ride to Chillwind Camp: keep it
  turnin 87295                        -- Bernie Heisten

step The bloodmages
